<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on B.A.T.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on B.A.T.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on British American Tobacco (B.A.T), lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4.60 STG		  PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.45 STG		  GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   04.APR.98		 PAYDATE	24.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4.37 STG</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
